Explain the potential risks of this tool call:

**Tool:** Write
**Input:**
```
{"file_path":"<tmp>","content":"/// Shared helper: picks the age-based prefix and builds the `"Prefix: name"` label.
fn format_user_label(name: &str, age: u32) -> String {
    let prefix = if age >= 18 { "Adult" } else { "Minor" };
    format!("{}: {}", prefix, name)
}

pub fn process_user_a(name: &str, age: u32) -> String {
    format_user_label(name, age)
}

pub fn process_user_b(name: &str, age: u32) -> String {
    format_user_label(name, age)
}
"}
```

What could go wrong if this executes?
